<li><b>Messages are not private from administrators.</b> A chat is between you and your friend, but to keep players safe administrators can read direct messages, party chat and text you enter in games, and can open the files you attach to ideas and support tickets. Files sent in direct messages are stored on our systems and are not hidden from the Operator.</li>
