<tr><td>Cloudflare</td><td>Relay to our database when it cannot be reached directly, at gameplay-api.vitalang.net; issue of TURN credentials to signed-in players; STUN server and TURN relay for multiplayer</td><td>IP address; for the relay, the requests that pass through it; for the TURN relay, encrypted game traffic</td></tr>
